# Applies to every response. Cloudflare (both Pages and Workers Static
# Assets) and Netlify both read this file automatically — no other config
# needed.
#
# Only the headers with ZERO chance of breaking the app are set here.
# Content-Security-Policy is deliberately NOT set: getting it right means
# explicitly allow-listing Firebase Auth/Firestore's domains, any fonts,
# and inline styles from Tailwind/framer-motion — get one of those wrong
# and the whole app silently breaks (blank screen, no console-visible
# reason to a non-technical reader) with no way to test it against the
# real Cloudflare deployment from here first. Add it later as its own
# carefully-tested change, not bundled in with this.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
